WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.120
You're Shiori, right?

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.620
Huh? Yeah.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.500
Please make me your slave!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.000
Hey!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.750
Which one'a you's the master?

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.370
The duel'll be a punch-out.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:18.620
Accept it or I'll just straight-up kill you.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.160
Stop!

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.000
Lemme go!

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.000
Don't tell me... I lost?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.290
Why is this happening to me?!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:46.450
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:58.120
Hajime kara nani mo nozomanakerya

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:05.870
Kono kokoro shizumu koto nai no kana

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:14.750
Aisareru yorokobi nara shitteiru kedo

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:23.330
Monotarinai mitasarenai nayami wa tsukinai

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:29.290
Karakara na kokoro uruoshite kureyo

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:33.080
Afureru hodo yu wo sosoide kure

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.620
Munashiku tada hibiku kono sakebigoe

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:44.870
Taikutsu de arifureteiru mainichi demo

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.540
Kono mi ni ataerareta koufuku da to

00:01:48.540 --> 00:02:01.000
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.500
-plan-

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:11.830
Hey.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.370
Hold on a sec, Bro.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.160
What?

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.750
Zenichi
Bunkyo

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.790
You roughed up our lovely Ayaka-chan
and left her as damaged goods.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.370
Then you skipped out on payin'.
The fuck are you doin'?

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:36.620
The hell are these guys? Yakuza?

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.500
Hey, you listenin' to me?!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.790
You're gonna pay us whatcha owe us!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.250
Sto...

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.910
Dammit, you bastard!

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.500
Wanna know somethin'?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.160
I hate bein' bossed around more than fuckin' anything!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.250
M... motherfucker...

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:15.000
Wow, look at you, so strong.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.200
Huh? The hell are you?

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:20.120
Me? Well.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.200
I'm looking for badasses like you.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.410
Muon Nerima?

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:35.500
That old fart was the head of a gang that ran
a whole spread of red-light businesses in Kabuki-cho.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:41.330
He was thinkin' about retiring soon and was
lookin' for someone who could take over for him.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:45.410
Well? Will you be my successor?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.500
Your guts, your courage...

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.040
I can tell you'll go far.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.910
Maybe you could make this group even bigger than I did.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.700
Me, runnin' a gang...

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:07.080
A boss with the whole world of nightlife under his thumb,
not to mention all the money and women...

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.410
Yeah, sure! I'll do it!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.660
Good, good, I like that decisiveness you've got!

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:16.790
Well then, could I give you a little test?

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.370
A test?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.080
Come on now, it's just a little job.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.410
I'm sure you could handle it easily.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.080
Do you know what this is?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.250
Huh?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.120
This is called an SCM.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.750
The old fart gave me a job.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:46.580
Wear the SCM. If someone wearing one
loses a game to me, she becomes my slave.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.160
I'll use the SCM to get a bunch of women
to be my slaves.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.120
Of course, you won't do it for free.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.950
I'll give you a million yen for each slave you bring to me.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:02.080
After that, I forgot about the SCM for a while.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.580
Then a signal popped up on the map
when I was in Akihabara.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.450
I found two women in a park who were wearing SCMs.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.750
I thought, "Damn, today's my lucky day!"

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.120
I enslaved one of them right off the bat,

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.000
and even though the other one got away,
I knew I'd catch her.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.120
I felt like I was on top of the world.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:24.620
Fuck... this is a real pain.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:27.120
The other chick was the master, huh...

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.000
Huh?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.450
Something's comin' close!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.330
Huh?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:41.700
A dog?!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.700
What the fuck?!

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.040
Fine then, you wanna go, huh?!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.450
Huh?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.500
Why'd a duel start?!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.000
Wait, does that mean this dog is wearing an SCM?!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.200
Heh. Bring it on!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:07.660
I don't care if you're a dog or whatever,
you pick a fight with me, you get one!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.750
Shit!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.950
I can't lose... Today's supposed to be my lucky day...

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.700
This fuckin' dog...!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.700
You're... the one I fed...

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.660
Adachi-san!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.580
I'm so sorry, it's all my fault...

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.870
I'm so sorry!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.250
What about Zenichi?

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:56.250
The dog... Zushiohmaru took care of him.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.250
Really? Thanks.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.870
Hey there.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:09.620
How does it feel to be slave to a dog?

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.370
The hell do you want?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.700
My name is Ataru Chuo, Zen Nichi Bunkyo-kun.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.410
It ain't "Zen Nichi", it's Zenichi!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.660
Oh, sorry about that.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:28.870
I don't know why that dog is wearing an SCM,
but seriously, why did you try to duel a dog?

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.370
Shut up!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.910
Shit, my body moved on its own...

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.700
Taking orders from a dog, now?

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.580
You can understand what it's saying?

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:48.450
So, Zenichi-kun, you don't like
being a dog's slave, do you?

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.450
Be our ally instead.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.950
Fuck no.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.370
I'd rather die than let someone boss me around!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.080
Guess I've got no choice, then.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.790
Wait!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.500
Please, wait!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.000
Let me do it.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.830
I'm the one who dragged Shiori-san into this.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.120
Let me settle this.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.330
Nakano-chan...

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:25.250
Let's have a duel.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.330
The duel...

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.830
...will be a punch-out!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:39.580
Yeah, we captured three total. I'll bring them to you now.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:44.000
Oh, but one's going to be in the hospital for a bit.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:53.040
I've fulfilled my promise, which means I win.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.450
Right.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.870
Hey, who are these people?

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.370
I asked them for their help rescuing you.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.330
Okay.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.500
You'll need to come with us.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.200
Where?

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.080
To our boss' place.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:13.580
Your boss?

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.000
Our master.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.580
Master Ryuuou.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.750
Ryuuou?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:24.200
I'm sorry, but please, just do as they say.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.750
Oh, right, what about him?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:42.700
Zushi?!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.830
Zushi! Where have you been?!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.830
You're that dog's owner?

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:59.120
Yes, that's right. I never thought I'd see him again.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.410
I see.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.950
I know you've only just found him,
but could you let us have him?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:12.290
I need that dog and the SCM he's wearing
for the work we're doing.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.660
We plan on making the best use of him.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.450
Zushi's wearing an SCM?!

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:21.750
Could you tell us what's going on?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.540
Or will your master get mad at you if you talk?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.620
Would Ryuuou get upset?

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.000
Cocky one, aren't you?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.750
Yuuga Ohta and Eia Arakawa.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.450
We're heading back.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.500
Get in, you two.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.500
Do you want to be released from slavery?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.870
Get in. Hurry.

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.200
Right!

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.410
You that afraid of your master, Old Man?

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.950
My name's not "Old Man". It's Chuo.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.290
Chuo-san.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.790
I'd release you from slavery right away, you know.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:16.080
You know, if you want strangers to trust you,

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.120
you should stop lying to them.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.000
Let's go home, Zushi.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.580
A while back, he ran away from home all of a sudden.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.080
I thought we'd never find him.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.830
I was so worried...

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.330
But why's he wearing an SCM?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.250
That's right, Zushi, why are you wearing an SCM?!

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.660
Let's take it out!

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.580
You don't want to? But why?

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:08.750
He wouldn't have put it in all by himself.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.000
Someone made Zushiohmaru wear that SCM.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.410
But for what? It's a real mystery.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.700
Hey, don't you dare get Zushi involved in this.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:27.410
They tried to take Zushi away from us. What for?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:33.750
That Chuo guy with the glasses, and Julia, the lab rat...

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.000
Then there's the other two girls.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.950
It's likely that the four of them are all Ryuuou's slaves.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:43.160
And Ryuuou stole Seiya, too.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.370
That means they have at least five slaves.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.910
The only slave I've got is Ayaka.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.040
Yeah, I just ran into him. He's with me now.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.040
Yes, really! I'll bring him home.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.290
Text me.
Where's my money?
Answer me already
Text me back.
I'm worried about you.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.040
Sorry, but I can't give you your money back.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.410
I gave it all to Eia for my insurance money.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:46.200
Zero
Shinagawa

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.120
Every day is the same.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.830
Wake up at the same time, travel the same road.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:06.790
Work the same hours, doing the same job.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.950
I don't talk to anyone, but that's just fine.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.700
That's the way I want it.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:38.910
Good morning.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.700
Huh? G-good morning...

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.950
Hey Mister, do you work at the bread factory?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.950
How'd you know?

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:56.700
That's the only place that offers night shifts around here.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.660
Huh...

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.750
Umm, you've... you've gotta get to school, right?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.120
No, I don't go to school. I have other things to do.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:10.700
O-oh, okay.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.250
Well, I've gotta be off...

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.000
Hey, Mister?

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.250
I want you to help me with something.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.500
Huh?

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.500
I want you to help me avenge my dad.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.290
What?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.500
This is an SCM.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:33.870
My dad lost a duel with this and went crazy.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.700
Huh? An S...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.790
An SCM enslaves someone who loses a duel to you.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.500
After someone enslaved my dad, he ran away,

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.790
but he wasn't wearing his SCM,
so his brain was severely damaged.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.910
He passed out here. This is where they found him.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.500
Slaves? Brain damage?

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.330
What is this kid talking about?

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.620
It was on the news, remember?

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.700
Someone found an unconscious man lying here.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:05.330
Man Found Unconscious On Bank of Arakawa River Police Unsure Whether Accident

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:05.330
- Businessman

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:05.330
or Foul Play
Worked Like a
Slave Every Day

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:05.080
Oh, I think I remember that story...

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.620
I can't rely on the police.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.410
I'd wear this SCM and take out his opponent.

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.330
To do that, I'd need to challenge him to a duel.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.200
H-hey, hold on...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:19.370
But if he thinks he's up against a kid,
he might not take me up on a duel!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.120
That's why I need your help, Mister!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.750
Huh? Help? My help?

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:30.120
All this talk about revenge
is straight out of a manga.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.370
That, and...

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.580
I don't want to get involved with anyone anymore...

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:37.870
I'm sorry, I can't.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.830
You should try to stay out of danger if you can. Goodbye.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:44.950
You don't believe me, do you?

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:50.080
Nobody believes anything I say!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:55.450
Nobody believes anything I say!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.870
It was him! Zero did it!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.080
It wasn't me! I don't know anything about it!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.870
I knew it was Shinagawa.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.500
He doesn't have any parents, right?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.830
Wallet thief!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.620
It wasn't me, you have to believe me!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:27.330
So the opponent for our duel will come here?

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.080
Yeah, it's almost the time we agreed on.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.950
Put in the SCM.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.080
Wait, I'm gonna wear it?!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.500
Please! We have to trick him!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.410
It vibrated?

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.450
Hey, are you the one who wanted to duel?

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.290
We really are going to duel...

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.120
Are you a student?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.950
That your little brother?

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.700
Just get the duel started!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.950
Your little brother sure is impatient.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:13.200
Alright then, how about we duel with a trivia game?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:18.660
Over 10,000 unique questions!
All genres!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:18.660
QUIZ Q
TRAINING

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.700
This app will randomly display
a trivia question from a list of ten thousand.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.620
Each of us reads a question to the other, and
whoever answers three questions correctly first wins.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.830
How's that sound?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.410
U-umm...

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.200
Okay.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.370
But only on one condition.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.080
I'm gonna play, too.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.660
You? Really?

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:37.870
Well, sure. Alright then, Kid.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.000
Does that sound good?

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.870
Huh, oh, yeah...

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.620
Okay then. Let's start!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:48.540
Right then, you read the first question to me.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.120
Uh... sure.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:55.330
Umm... in a deck of cards,
what does the suit of diamonds represent?

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.620
In a deck of cards,
what does the suit of
diamonds represent?

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.290
The answer is "coinage".

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.750
Basically, it represents merchants. That right?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.790
Coinage
(merchants)
Next Question

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.790
That's correct.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.120
Okay then, it's my turn to read to you.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.830
The human nervous system is separated into two parts.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:14.790
The human nervous system
is separated into two parts.
One is the peripheral nervous system.
What is the other?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.540
One is the peripheral nervous system. What is the other?

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.700
The central nervous system,
comprised of the brain and spinal cord.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.200
The central
nervous system

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.200
That's correct.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.080
What is the capital of Jamaica?

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:20.830
Kingston.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.200
That's right.

